{
  "an6.45:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 6.45 ",
  "an6.45:0.2": "5. Dhammikavagga ",
  "an6.45:0.3": "Iṇasutta ",
  "an6.45:1.1": "“Dāliddiyaṁ, bhikkhave, dukkhaṁ lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino”ti? ",
  "an6.45:1.2": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "an6.45:2.1": "“Yampi, bhikkhave, daliddo assako anāḷhiko iṇaṁ ādiyati, iṇādānampi, bhikkhave, dukkhaṁ lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino”ti? ",
  "an6.45:2.2": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "an6.45:3.1": "“Yampi, bhikkhave, daliddo assako anāḷhiko iṇaṁ ādiyitvā vaḍḍhiṁ paṭissuṇāti, vaḍḍhipi, bhikkhave, dukkhā lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino”ti? ",
  "an6.45:3.2": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "an6.45:4.1": "“Yampi, bhikkhave, daliddo assako anāḷhiko vaḍḍhiṁ paṭissuṇitvā kālābhataṁ vaḍḍhiṁ na deti, codentipi naṁ; ",
  "an6.45:4.2": "codanāpi, bhikkhave, dukkhā lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino”ti? ",
  "an6.45:4.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "an6.45:5.1": "“Yampi, bhikkhave, daliddo assako anāḷhiko codiyamāno na deti, anucarantipi naṁ; ",
  "an6.45:5.2": "anucariyāpi, bhikkhave, dukkhā lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino”ti? ",
  "an6.45:5.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "an6.45:6.1": "“Yampi, bhikkhave, daliddo assako anāḷhiko anucariyamāno na deti, bandhantipi naṁ; ",
  "an6.45:6.2": "bandhanampi, bhikkhave, dukkhaṁ lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino”ti? ",
  "an6.45:6.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "an6.45:7.1": "“Iti kho, bhikkhave, dāliddiyampi dukkhaṁ lokasmiṁ kāmabhogino, iṇādānampi dukkhaṁ lokasmi